                <pb facs="0804" n="790" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v1/pg790"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hoar,
                        Attorney-General, to Mr. Barlow, United
                        States marshal.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-06-19"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 19,
                        1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis C. Barlow</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States Marshal, New York City:</hi></p>
                <p>Military expedition, to sail within two days, reported as organizing at 71
                    Broadway, room 36 at 636 Broadway, at 12 East Houston street, and in New York
                    Casino, same street. Look out for them.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. R. HOAR,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Attorney-General.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
